# madcide keybinding profile: Pico-style single chords — the SAME action
# vocabulary as joe.keys respelled onto the subset that fits one chord.
# The adapter is data all the way down; a swap is one ui::tui_bind_keys
# call. (No ^h/^i/^j/^m: those bytes ARE backspace/tab/enter. Arrows,
# home/end, pgup/pgdn serve motion here — the diamond is JOE's.)
^s save
^q quit
^x discard
^g help
^w find
^l findnext
^b mark
^n bend
^k blockdel
^u blockcopy
^v blockmove
^z undo
^^ redo
^e check
^o outline
^p profile
^y delline
^d delword
^t gotoline
^r insertfile
